   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Maintaining healthy habits is crucial during middle adulthood to prevent age-related decline. Discuss the role of exercise, diet, and preventive health measures in promoting well-being during middle adulthood. How do these habits mitigate the physical changes that typically occur during this stage of life? Provide examples from the text and consider how individuals might adjust their routines to maintain health as they age.",
